<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Protection from Evil</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 22), Paladin (guild level 32)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast protection from evil &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast protection from evil</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Wards the target against evil. Whenever someone of evil alignment attacks 
them, monster or player, the target defends better: against blows, with their 
shield, and against spells alike.
</p><p>The better your protection sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. It doesn't add up on someone who already has it. You must be 
standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection from Good</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Alignment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>